The legal text is the Constitution of Bosnia and Herzegovina (Annex 4 to the General Framework
Agreement for Peace in Bosnia and Herzegovina), in the English text published by the Constitutional
Court of Bosnia and Herzegovina (https://www.ustavnisud.ba). The Court's site states no licence; the
text is an official legislative text, reproduced here unchanged apart from layout.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be
reused under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice and not an
official publication.
